       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I noticed a couple things and pushed a patch. Here’s what changed:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a collision bug where Jack could get stuck in the Party Palace on the ramp near the ball pit.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Rat trap tweak: when Jack trips, he can’t immediately snatch you if you run past him.",
